      "rationale": "This concept adapts the DFM-safe reference by increasing corner radii to 15mm for a soft pebble silhouette, reducing height to 25mm for a slim profile, and switching to rABS with textured_light finish in dark grey to meet cost and scuff-hiding requirements. The front layout places the display at 35% height for ergonomic viewing and the intake below at 75% height, with USB on the right side for cable management. The two-part shell with a simple seam maintains budget tooling. Mass is estimated at 98g (housing) plus 92g internals = 190g, slightly above the 180g target; wall thickness reduction to 1.8mm could bring it to 180g. The cost target of CNY 12 is challenging; rABS and simplified tooling help, but supplier negotiation may be needed. The design preserves all must-haves: two-part shell, printed logo only, budget tooling, desk-knock durability, and scuff-hiding colour."
